melody:
When the black-bird in the spring,
D4 G4 F#4 G4 A4 E4 A4(2)
on the wil-low tree,
G4 F#4 E4 F#4 G4(4)
sat and rocked, I heard him sing,
D4 G4 F#4 G4 A4 E4 A4(2)
sing-ing Au-ra Lee.
G4 F#4 E4 F#4 G4(4)
Au-ra Lee, Au-ra Lee,
B4. B4/ B4(2) B4. B4/ B4(2)
maid of gold-en hair;
B4 A4 G4 A4 B4(4)
sun-shine came a-long with thee, and
B4 B4 C5 B4 A4 E4 A4. G4/
swal-lows in the air.
G4 F#4 B4. A4/ G4(4)
